    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the slippery, invincible character named &quot;NULLKO&quot; to return home.<br>&quot;KOKORONULL&quot; is a hardcore action game that adds the element of &quot;slipperiness&quot; to the usual platform action gameplay.  <br>Conquering all 20 stages is an impressive achievement. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030020/extras/4a2338e935735bd5f9890f5612a9d798.poster.avif?t=1755423126\" width=590 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030020/extras/4a2338e935735bd5f9890f5612a9d798.webm?t=1755423126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030020/extras/4a2338e935735bd5f9890f5612a9d798.mp4?t=1755423126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game &quot;KOKORONULL&quot; allows the creation of gameplay videos and derivative works. When publishing videos, please include the URL of this game's Steam page (this page).</p>",
